<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71992" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄγμος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>furrow</i> in ploughing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὶ δὲ στρέψασκον ἀν᾽ ὄγμους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					18.546
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίονες ὄγμοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>h.Cer.</u>
					455
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>swathe</i> in reaping, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥς τ᾽ ἀμητῆρες ὄ. ἐλαύνωσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					11.68
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δράγματα δ᾽ ἄλλα μετ᾽ ὄ. . . πῖπτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					18.552
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				557
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄ. ἄγειν ὀρθόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					10.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>strip</i> of cultivated land (written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὤγμος</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>PFay.</u>
				120.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				166.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅ τε πλήθει μέγας
			ὄ.</span> [the moon's] vast <i>orbit</i> is accomplished,
				<i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Hom.</u>
				32.11
			</span></i> ; of the sun, <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				749
			</span></i> ; of a hippopotamus, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλίσσυτον ὄ. ἐλαύνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					571
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄ. κακῶν . . γήραος,</span>
			i.e. wrinkled old age, <i><span class="en">
				Archil.
				116
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄ. ὀδόντων</span>
			<i>row</i> of teeth, <i><span class="en">
				<u>APl.</u>
				4.265
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
